# Take the stairs down to the next level and walk on.
# Needs test slot 9: python -I tools/makesave.py 2 9 39300577.MIF 0 4800 4928 256 "stairs test"
# (level 0 of a three-level dungeon, in the corridor south of its stairs down,
# facing north).
save 9
wait 2
hold up 20
check after_stairs
wait 3
hold up 15
check walked_on
end
